<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 11.95 to 7286.16.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.63 to 435.60, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.16.</p>
<p>Winners outnumbered losers 1473 to 993.</p>
<p>Volume was 498,746,800 compared with 489,701,900, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
